Find out what all the national flags look like and learn the capitals of every country in the world with our quiz game! Have fun, remember, improve and get new knowledge in the field of world geography!

The mechanics of the game are simple and will be interesting for children, schoolchildren, students and adults. Beautiful, convenient and intuitive application interface. Nothing extra.

More than 200 countries of the world, their flags, capitals and currencies! Explore the world separately by continent: Europe, Asia, Africa, North and South America, Australia and Oceania.

Learn to identify the country on the WORLD MAP:

- find countries on the map, determine their location;
- color the world map by choosing the right country;
- see your progress by continent;
- change the scale of the map to accurately guess the country.

The game is divided into 5 modes with levels:

FLAGS: choose the correct country flag from the four offered;
LANDMARKS: guess the country whose landmark is shown on the screen;
CURRENCY: find out where in the world which currency is used;
CAPITALS: guess the capital of each country;
QUIZ: find out more interesting facts about countries around the world - choose the country that is written on the card.

Easily change the language in the app: English, French, Spanish, Russian, German, Ukrainian, Turkish, Chinese, Korean, Japanese and Arabic.

Make the most of your time! Start the geography quiz right now! Our team wishes you good luck!

If you like the app, please leave us a review. It means a lot to us.
